(hierarchical_label "H2" (shape passive) (at 102.87 121.92 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid "d34f4427-7671-4778-aa0f-76dfba2cfa03"))
(text "NOR2_N16: Y = ~(A | B). One 6N16B (6Н16Б): two triodes, plates in parallel on Ra.\nInputs A, B: LV level, straight to the grids (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V).\nOutput Y: HV level on the plates (1 = +150 V, 0 = +50 V).\nSimulated: Y = 147 / 55 V (one input high) / 39 V (both); switching point -2.2 V on the grid.\nEach HV net that drives grids needs a divider HV -> LV: 470k || C1 from Y to the LV net,\n200k from the LV net to -50 V, C1 = 3.9 pF per grid on that net (see NOR2_N16_tb).\nLV inputs must come from such a divider (grid current is limited by it), never from a stiff source.\nUnused input: tie it to the other input. Supplies: +150 V, -50 V (dividers only), heater 6.3 V 0.4 A on H1/H2.\nPage: sch/logic/NOR2_N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c802131d-4fc7-420d-acad-1e58d5fb817a"))

(embedded_fonts no))
